"The store path must be absolute." = "存储库路径必须是绝对路径。";
"The system returned unrecognized disk information." = "系统返回了无法识别的磁盘信息。";
"The user directory path is too long for a local control connection." = "用户目录过长，无法创建本地控制连接。";
"This image and its exclusive current changes will be deleted. Existing snapshots and derived images will be kept. Space will not be reclaimed immediately. This cannot be undone." = "将删除此镜像及其独有的当前修改，已有快照和派生镜像保留。空间不会立即回收。此操作无法撤销。";
"This image is read-only. Create a writable image from a snapshot first." = "此镜像只读，请从快照创建可写镜像后设置。";
"This node has upstream layers. Go back to see them." = "此节点还有上游层，返回上一级可查看。";
"This setting applies to this image. Existing snapshots and other derived images keep their settings. Safely unmount before changing it." = "设置只作用于此镜像，已有快照和其他派生镜像保持不变。需要安全卸载后才能修改。";
"This snapshot's restore point will be deleted. Existing images, other snapshots, and derived images will be kept. Referenced shared layers will not be deleted, and space will not be reclaimed immediately. This cannot be undone." = "将删除此快照保存的恢复点，已有镜像、其他快照和派生镜像保留。仍被引用的共享层不会删除，空间不会立即回收。此操作无法撤销。";
"Timed out waiting for the background service. Try again or check diagnostics." = "等待后台服务超时，请重试或查看诊断信息。";
"Total Referenced Allocation" = "引用空间占用合计";
"Turn on OverlayBDFSKit in the File System Extensions panel. The app will check again automatically when you return." = "在打开的“文件系统扩展”面板中，开启 OverlayBDFSKit。返回 App 后会自动重新检查。";
