"Usage is sampled from allocated host blocks, including referenced shared layers. It does not indicate reclaimable space or include all metadata and caches." = "占用按宿主已分配块采样，包含引用的共享层；不代表可释放空间，也不包含所有元数据和缓存。";
"Use data you can recreate. Online snapshots do not guarantee application consistency. The app safely unmounts devices before quitting; if a volume is busy, the app and background service remain running." = "请使用可重新获取的数据。在线快照不保证任意应用的一致性。退出 App 时会先安全卸载设备；卷被占用时会保留 App 和后台服务。";
"Uses APFS and allocates space as needed. Before creation, free space must cover the selected capacity; this check does not reserve or preallocate space. Images and snapshots share the store above. Only the newly created virtual disk is formatted, after verifying its ownership." = "使用 APFS 格式，按需占用空间。创建前要求可用空间足以容纳所选容量；检查不会锁定或预分配空间。镜像和快照统一存放在上述存储库。创建时只格式化本次新建且经过归属核验的虚拟磁盘。";
